---
title: "Download descriptor ownership"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> waiting
  waiting --> owned: Acquire flock
  owned --> downloading: Start transport with inherited descriptor
  downloading --> ready: Transport closes its descriptor
  ready --> done: Parent closes its descriptor
  owned --> done: Cache hit or failure closes descriptor
  downloading --> orphaned: Parent is killed
  orphaned --> done: Transport exits and releases final descriptor
  waiting --> done: Cancel or timeout
